  "pureNames": [
    "UTF-8 limits count Chinese and supplementary characters without TextEncoder",
    "actual initializer publishes readiness only after all native boundaries",
    "already closed document does not start a native connection",
    "bounded duration and categories reject before crossing the client",
    "cancel-request is not a cancelled terminal",
    "contradictory task identity and malformed progress are rejected",
    "credential/extra fields cannot be persisted as UI state",
    "current terminal unsubscribe failure remains visible without changing native result",
    "dispose removes observation and subscription without claiming native completion",
    "document close during connect prevents every later request and readiness publication",
    "document close during describe prevents every later request and readiness publication",
    "document close during discover prevents every later request and readiness publication",
    "document close during probe prevents every later request and readiness publication",
    "fixed dataset has exact identities and deterministic endpoints",
    "full fixed summary conserves every row and filtered group",
    "late accepted start after disposal requests only best-effort cancellation",
    "late cancel acknowledgement cannot mutate or query a successor task",
    "late cancel rejection cannot publish an error into a successor task",
    "local observation deadline retains unknown and never cancels or restarts native work",
    "missing start acknowledgement permits only query by same operation, never a second start",
    "missing storage is explicit empty rather than recovered",
    "native discovery rejection propagates without task or ready publication",
    "native success stops local observation without manufacturing a task result",
    "old subscription ready rejection is inert after a new task starts",
    "old unsubscribe rejection is inert after a new task starts",
    "public timeout state remains observable and does not mean cancellation",
    "query not-found means unknown and cannot cause automatic replay",
    "reload restores only bounded UI state and explains old task as unknown",
    "selection and viewport reject non-integer/out-of-range inputs",
    "selection is bounded, unique and copied",
    "shared GUI and view controls bind enabled and busy to current task identity and state",
    "sort/filter uses same data and does not mutate original order",
    "start calls actual client interface once; initial zero-progress running is valid",
    "starting observer disposal stops native dispatch and every observation resource",
    "synchronous task observer closure prevents the next native probe",
    "virtual window caps actual DOM rows to 80 even for an oversized viewport",
    "wrong fixture and row bounds reject",
    "wrong fixture, duplicate selections, oversized drafts and malformed bytes reject"
  ],
